<title>USA: RSI launches new videoconference systems.</title>
<headline>RSI launches new videoconference systems.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>RSI Systems Inc said Tuesday it launched a new series of videoconferencing systems which do not require a personal computer.</p>
<p>The new systems -- the Professional 1000, the Portable 1000 and the Roll-Around 1000 -- have interfaces based on a telephone keypad and are designed to be more user friendly, RSI said.</p>
<p>Systems start at $7,495.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
